WEBVTT

00:04.980 --> 00:05.740
<b>This is…</b>

00:05.980 --> 00:07.860
<b>You probably haven't seen it before.</b>

00:09.780 --> 00:11.180
<b>That's a gold coin.</b>

00:11.540 --> 00:16.450
<b>Something you could
never earn in a lifetime.</b>

00:16.820 --> 00:18.060
<b>Aston, what is this…</b>

00:18.060 --> 00:18.900
<b>Zenos.</b>

00:19.600 --> 00:21.920
<b>You haven't contributed
anything lately, have you?</b>

00:22.260 --> 00:24.140
<b>I'll be frank, we don't need you anymore.</b>

00:24.500 --> 00:26.180
<b>It's not true that I haven't contributed.</b>

00:26.800 --> 00:27.840
<b>And back then,</b>

00:28.380 --> 00:29.620
<b>it was you who invited me.</b>

00:33.600 --> 00:36.360
<b>So you were born an idiot.</b>

00:36.880 --> 00:40.620
<b>I never reject someone useful.</b>

00:41.160 --> 00:45.020
<b>Even if you died for me,
I wouldn't feel a thing.</b>

00:45.260 --> 00:48.060
<b>Paupers are like livestock.</b>

00:48.240 --> 00:50.220
<b>As long as we feed them,</b>

00:50.220 --> 00:52.520
<b>they see us as friends.</b>

00:52.800 --> 00:54.820
<b>How funny.</b>

00:55.220 --> 00:56.820
<b>We've become strong.</b>

00:57.140 --> 00:59.640
<b>We are now one of the famous teams.</b>

00:59.640 --> 01:01.060
<b>Because of me…</b>

01:01.580 --> 01:06.800
<b>Don't tell me it's because of
your unique healing magic.</b>

01:07.380 --> 01:11.680
<b>From now on, we have to perform
in front of nobles and royals.</b>

01:12.280 --> 01:15.760
<b>If there's a pauper on the team,
it will stain our image.</b>

01:20.340 --> 01:21.860
<b>That's my farewell gift to you.</b>

01:22.100 --> 01:24.240
<b>With that, you can go anywhere.</b>

01:24.840 --> 01:25.660
<b>Listen.</b>

01:25.920 --> 01:30.840
<b>Don't tell anyone that
you were part of our Golden Phoenix.</b>

01:31.560 --> 01:33.380
<b>So, this is hush money?</b>

01:36.060 --> 01:36.920
<b>I understand.</b>

01:45.320 --> 01:46.800
<b>No, let go of me!</b>

01:47.260 --> 01:48.260
<b>No!</b>

01:48.260 --> 01:49.560
<b>Stop it!</b>

02:06.100 --> 02:13.570
<b>The Brilliant Healer's New Life in the Shadows</b>

03:21.580 --> 03:23.340
<b>No, stop!</b>

03:24.720 --> 03:26.040
<b>That's a precious elf.</b>

03:26.040 --> 03:27.680
<b>Don't let her get away.</b>

03:27.920 --> 03:30.000
<b>You can't escape.</b>

03:30.000 --> 03:31.940
<b>Little elf.</b>

03:42.620 --> 03:43.680
<b>Darn it.</b>

03:55.620 --> 03:58.020
<b>Let go of me, you brat.</b>

04:02.380 --> 04:04.220
<b>Where should I go now?</b>

04:05.040 --> 04:06.620
<b>Darn brat.</b>

04:06.960 --> 04:07.800
<b>Hmm?</b>

04:08.300 --> 04:10.900
<b>Idiot, how are we going to sell her now?</b>

04:10.900 --> 04:12.040
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

04:12.040 --> 04:13.100
<b>It's because…</b>

04:16.340 --> 04:18.080
<b>Hey, did you stab a child?</b>

04:18.400 --> 04:20.860
<b>What? This brat is our goods.</b>

04:21.080 --> 04:22.990
<b>You have no right to butt in.</b>

04:24.660 --> 04:25.380
<b>Well,</b>

04:25.740 --> 04:27.100
<b>I'll buy her then.</b>

04:28.540 --> 04:30.000
<b>Deal.</b>

04:30.180 --> 04:31.660
<b>She is yours.</b>

04:31.660 --> 04:32.280
<b>Huh?</b>

04:32.280 --> 04:33.200
<b>Let's go.</b>

04:35.980 --> 04:38.620
<b>She's dying anyway.
Better to cash out now.</b>

04:38.880 --> 04:41.520
<b>That's impressive, sis.</b>

04:42.060 --> 04:43.320
<b>Hey, are you okay?</b>

04:43.800 --> 04:47.140
<b>Will I… die?</b>

04:47.540 --> 04:48.520
<b>No, you won't.</b>

04:48.520 --> 04:49.940
<b>This kind of minor injury can be treated.</b>

04:54.220 --> 04:55.640
<b>It can't…</b>

04:55.900 --> 04:57.940
<b>I no longer feel any pain.</b>

04:58.300 --> 04:59.720
<b>I've already healed your wound.</b>

04:59.720 --> 05:01.110
<b>You should be able to speak normally now.</b>

05:01.460 --> 05:02.040
<b>Huh?</b>

05:02.300 --> 05:03.020
<b>What?</b>

05:03.500 --> 05:05.500
<b>It didn't hurt, and there are no scars.</b>

05:05.820 --> 05:08.180
<b>I thought I would die.</b>

05:08.380 --> 05:10.330
<b>Why did I recover?</b>

05:10.800 --> 05:12.200
<b>Because I'm a healer.</b>

05:12.760 --> 05:15.160
<b>I just have to remove the arrow,
repair the body tissue,</b>

05:15.160 --> 05:16.440
<b>and then heal the wound.</b>

05:17.920 --> 05:19.000
<b>Thank you.</b>

05:19.580 --> 05:21.400
<b>Thank you, big brother.</b>

05:22.740 --> 05:23.620
<b>Um…</b>

05:24.040 --> 05:25.040
<b>What's your name?</b>

05:25.720 --> 05:26.540
<b>Lily.</b>

05:26.880 --> 05:29.010
<b>Oh… your money…</b>

05:29.680 --> 05:31.760
<b>You mean the gold coin I paid them?</b>

05:32.180 --> 05:33.060
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

05:33.760 --> 05:35.860
<b>It was Aston's severance pay.</b>

05:36.240 --> 05:37.520
<b>It's useless anyway.</b>

05:37.940 --> 05:40.080
<b>Big brother, who are you then?</b>

05:40.380 --> 05:41.980
<b>Are you a famous healer?</b>

05:42.220 --> 05:43.740
<b>My name is Zenos.</b>

05:43.980 --> 05:45.860
<b>I don't have a healer's license.</b>

05:45.860 --> 05:47.360
<b>And I'm self-taught.</b>

05:47.960 --> 05:49.300
<b>By the way, where is your home?</b>

05:49.940 --> 05:51.960
<b>I… don't have a home…</b>

05:55.500 --> 05:57.940
<b>Anyway, I'll buy you some clothes,
and then we'll go eat.</b>

05:57.940 --> 05:58.760
<b>Lily.</b>

05:59.600 --> 06:01.260
<b>Uh… okay.</b>

06:06.900 --> 06:08.160
<b>This is so good.</b>

06:12.200 --> 06:13.840
<b>Zenos, aren't you eating?</b>

06:14.200 --> 06:16.140
<b>I'm not hungry.</b>

06:16.580 --> 06:17.520
<b>I see.</b>

06:19.500 --> 06:21.360
<b>Actually, it's because I have no money.</b>

06:21.980 --> 06:23.800
<b>But after this meal,</b>

06:24.260 --> 06:25.680
<b>what should I do with this child?</b>

06:26.120 --> 06:27.500
<b>Perhaps the orphanage in the slums…</b>

06:28.000 --> 06:28.800
<b>No.</b>

06:29.000 --> 06:32.280
<b>Just thinking about how she would
be treated there is disheartening.</b>

06:32.880 --> 06:35.380
<b>Zenos, where do you work as a healer?</b>

06:35.880 --> 06:39.100
<b>Honestly, I was just kicked out
of the adventurer team.</b>

06:39.500 --> 06:40.600
<b>I have nowhere to go now.</b>

06:41.080 --> 06:43.340
<b>Then you're just like me.</b>

06:44.220 --> 06:45.200
<b>Well.</b>

06:45.540 --> 06:48.000
<b>I'll go look for a job first.</b>

06:49.460 --> 06:50.520
<b>Excuse me.</b>

06:50.780 --> 06:52.280
<b>Give… give me water.</b>

06:54.540 --> 06:55.620
<b>That hand…</b>

06:56.380 --> 06:58.220
<b>Bullet wounds and extensive burns.</b>

06:58.520 --> 06:59.620
<b>Must be caused by a magic gun.</b>

06:59.880 --> 07:02.720
<b>Yes, I accidentally got shot.</b>

07:04.340 --> 07:07.020
<b>As long as the pain stops, I can hold on…</b>

07:07.460 --> 07:08.460
<b>Don't exaggerate.</b>

07:08.680 --> 07:10.160
<b>Although this isn't a minor scratch,</b>

07:10.160 --> 07:11.600
<b>it can still be healed immediately.</b>

07:11.920 --> 07:12.720
<b>What?</b>

07:12.980 --> 07:14.500
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

07:15.520 --> 07:16.380
<b>That said,</b>

07:16.680 --> 07:18.580
<b>this looks like a very deep wound.</b>

07:18.900 --> 07:21.260
<b>Combining a spell chant
should heal it more effectively.</b>

07:22.640 --> 07:23.560
<b>Heal.</b>

07:27.640 --> 07:29.460
<b>What did you just do…</b>

07:29.960 --> 07:31.240
<b>Who exactly are you…</b>

07:31.980 --> 07:34.880
<b>Zenos is a great healer.</b>

07:35.080 --> 07:36.220
<b>Zenos…</b>

07:37.020 --> 07:39.460
<b>I've never met such an amazing healer.</b>

07:42.120 --> 07:43.160
<b>I'm really grateful.</b>

07:45.700 --> 07:46.190
<b>Goodbye.</b>

07:46.760 --> 07:48.140
<b>I will remember you.</b>

07:51.880 --> 07:54.200
<b>Why aren't you talking, Zenos?</b>

07:55.020 --> 07:57.960
<b>Just as you pay
when you eat at a restaurant,</b>

07:58.460 --> 08:00.620
<b>a healer providing treatment at a clinic</b>

08:00.620 --> 08:02.360
<b>can charge for their services, right?</b>

08:03.020 --> 08:05.060
<b>I think that's normal.</b>

08:05.600 --> 08:07.220
<b>Yeah…</b>

08:09.380 --> 08:10.360
<b>Thank you.</b>

08:10.920 --> 08:11.720
<b>Hmm?</b>

08:11.720 --> 08:14.240
<b>You said that to me
after I healed you, right?</b>

08:14.520 --> 08:15.620
<b>'Thank you.'</b>

08:15.900 --> 08:17.300
<b>Someone saved my life,</b>

08:17.300 --> 08:19.930
<b>I think it's natural to thank them.</b>

08:22.000 --> 08:23.640
<b>I've decided.</b>

08:24.120 --> 08:25.700
<b>I want to open a clinic.</b>

08:26.060 --> 08:27.120
<b>A clinic?</b>

08:27.460 --> 08:29.180
<b>Your words made me very happy.</b>

08:29.860 --> 08:31.960
<b>No one has thanked me before.</b>

08:32.780 --> 08:33.480
<b>Ah.</b>

08:33.720 --> 08:35.360
<b>But people from the slums</b>

08:35.720 --> 08:37.540
<b>cannot get a license,</b>

08:37.540 --> 08:39.440
<b>and it is difficult to
start a business officially…</b>

08:40.240 --> 08:42.820
<b>In that case, I would be
operating without a license.</b>

08:42.820 --> 08:44.860
<b>An unlicensed healer…</b>

08:45.320 --> 08:46.660
<b>Unlicensed healer.</b>

08:46.660 --> 08:47.920
<b>Sounds cool.</b>

08:47.920 --> 08:49.220
<b>You are so cool.</b>

08:49.220 --> 08:51.360
<b>I want to operate the clinic with you.</b>

08:51.360 --> 08:52.080
<b>Eh?</b>

08:52.320 --> 08:55.120
<b>Opening a clinic
without a license is illegal.</b>

08:55.760 --> 08:58.120
<b>I can't drag an innocent child into this…</b>

08:58.540 --> 09:00.780
<b>You spent money to buy me,</b>

09:00.780 --> 09:02.760
<b>so you are my master.</b>

09:02.760 --> 09:04.680
<b>So I will follow you.</b>

09:04.680 --> 09:06.440
<b>I simply wanted to save you.</b>

09:07.040 --> 09:10.100
<b>You bought me, now you want to abandon me.</b>

09:10.420 --> 09:12.320
<b>So, this is all an act.</b>

09:13.240 --> 09:15.420
<b>Don't say things like that.</b>

09:17.380 --> 09:19.620
<b>I can only let you stay
until we find a safe place for you.</b>

09:19.840 --> 09:20.840
<b>Really?</b>

09:20.840 --> 09:22.220
<b>I'm so happy.</b>

09:22.220 --> 09:25.200
<b>I will devote myself to you, master.</b>

09:25.200 --> 09:27.400
<b>Stop saying things like that.</b>

09:31.200 --> 09:33.680
<b>Are you really going to open it here?</b>

09:34.060 --> 09:36.240
<b>Looks quite uninhabited…</b>

09:36.540 --> 09:38.260
<b>After all, this is the ruins street.</b>

09:38.580 --> 09:40.300
<b>Why do you choose this kind of place?</b>

09:40.580 --> 09:43.840
<b>I can't open in town without a license.</b>

09:44.140 --> 09:45.140
<b>I see.</b>

09:45.140 --> 09:46.840
<b>You are really smart.</b>

09:46.840 --> 09:49.840
<b>And there are many
vacant houses around here.</b>

09:52.000 --> 09:53.360
<b>It looks pretty good here.</b>

09:53.560 --> 09:54.300
<b>Eh?</b>

09:56.740 --> 09:58.560
<b>Let's go inside and take a look.</b>

09:58.560 --> 10:00.140
<b>Hmm…</b>

10:00.620 --> 10:01.960
<b>What's wrong? Are you scared?</b>

10:02.500 --> 10:03.300
<b>Because</b>

10:03.480 --> 10:04.740
<b>I once heard</b>

10:05.020 --> 10:08.720
<b>that monsters thrive
in eerie places like this.</b>

10:09.140 --> 10:11.540
<b>If the wraith appears, we're done for.</b>

10:11.820 --> 10:12.540
<b>Wraith?</b>

10:12.920 --> 10:15.420
<b>They are the monsters
at the top of the undead hierarchy.</b>

10:15.740 --> 10:17.560
<b>Although they look very much like humans,</b>

10:17.560 --> 10:19.780
<b>they can take someone's life
just by touching them.</b>

10:19.780 --> 10:22.480
<b>It's said they can also command ghosts.</b>

10:27.100 --> 10:27.730
<b>Ah.</b>

10:28.040 --> 10:29.520
<b>Zenos, wait a moment.</b>

10:30.300 --> 10:32.440
<b>Illuminate the night with holy light.</b>

10:32.440 --> 10:35.040
<b>Transform into the brilliance
that dispels shadows.</b>

10:35.040 --> 10:36.360
<b>Reveal the path ahead of me.</b>

10:36.700 --> 10:37.720
<b>Illuminate.</b>

10:39.040 --> 10:40.900
<b>You can use magic?</b>

10:41.060 --> 10:42.920
<b>Yes, only simple magic.</b>

10:45.100 --> 10:47.660
<b>Wow, this is really…</b>

10:49.620 --> 10:51.360
<b>Yes, it looks quite good.</b>

10:51.560 --> 10:53.100
<b>Oh, is it good?</b>

10:53.380 --> 10:55.380
<b>Yes, after all, it has a roof.</b>

10:55.740 --> 10:57.680
<b>It does have a roof…</b>

10:57.940 --> 11:01.560
<b>When I was still on the team,
we almost always camped outside.</b>

11:01.980 --> 11:02.700
<b>Oh.</b>

11:02.700 --> 11:04.540
<b>The pillars are also very sturdy.</b>

11:04.540 --> 11:06.220
<b>With some tidying up, it could be livable.</b>

11:06.720 --> 11:08.350
<b>You are a bit too optimistic…</b>

11:08.940 --> 11:10.620
<b>I have already lost everything anyway.</b>

11:10.860 --> 11:12.300
<b>Continuing to dwell on it won't help.</b>

11:23.600 --> 11:25.000
<b>It is the taste of life…</b>

11:25.840 --> 11:26.900
<b>Hand it over.</b>

11:27.440 --> 11:28.440
<b>Hand it over.</b>

11:29.140 --> 11:30.900
<b>Zenos, it's a wraith.</b>

11:30.900 --> 11:31.960
<b>There's a wraith here.</b>

11:32.360 --> 11:33.960
<b>So someone beat us to it.</b>

11:34.600 --> 11:37.440
<b>This is the most
habitable house in this area.</b>

11:37.440 --> 11:39.820
<b>Zenos, why are you still saying that…</b>

11:44.140 --> 11:44.590
<b>Heal.</b>

11:48.920 --> 11:49.840
<b>I see.</b>

11:50.060 --> 11:51.380
<b>So this is what a wraith is.</b>

11:51.800 --> 11:54.140
<b>I have killed around a hundred of them.</b>

11:54.740 --> 11:56.980
<b>There was a time
when Aston was in a bad mood,</b>

11:57.200 --> 11:59.920
<b>he threw me into the deepest part
of the underground labyrinth.</b>

11:59.920 --> 12:01.820
<b>I encountered
a large number of them there.</b>

12:02.380 --> 12:06.240
<b>So I know that undead monsters
fear healing magic.</b>

12:07.120 --> 12:10.020
<b>Legend has it that a wraith means death.</b>

12:10.260 --> 12:11.400
<b>But you killed over a hundred…</b>

12:11.720 --> 12:12.600
<b>Sorry.</b>

12:12.900 --> 12:15.420
<b>This house looks the most suitable.</b>

12:15.780 --> 12:18.880
<b>I will try my best not to disturb you,
can you spare some space for me?</b>

12:18.880 --> 12:20.920
<b>What nonsense are you talking about?</b>

12:21.700 --> 12:23.510
<b>Your life…</b>

12:24.320 --> 12:25.540
<b>Give it to me!</b>

12:25.800 --> 12:26.580
<b>Heal.</b>

12:27.800 --> 12:29.260
<b>Ah, sorry.</b>

12:29.260 --> 12:30.560
<b>I saw you charging at me
and acted reflexively.</b>

12:30.840 --> 12:32.160
<b>I meant no harm.</b>

12:32.580 --> 12:33.940
<b>Unforgivable.</b>

12:34.420 --> 12:38.080
<b>It's the first time a human dared to anger me,
the Undead King Carmilla.</b>

12:38.720 --> 12:40.640
<b>Come, my minions.</b>

12:41.040 --> 12:43.880
<b>Kill that foolish human.</b>

12:44.780 --> 12:45.980
<b>Zenos!</b>

12:46.300 --> 12:47.380
<b>Ah…</b>

12:47.640 --> 12:50.300
<b>If possible, I wanted to
borrow this house peacefully.</b>

12:50.640 --> 12:51.820
<b>High Heal.</b>

12:54.800 --> 12:56.420
<b>Wh-What's going on?</b>

12:56.900 --> 12:58.360
<b>Who on earth are you…?</b>

12:59.020 --> 13:01.060
<b>I'm just an unlicensed healer.</b>

13:01.880 --> 13:03.470
<b>Um, I'm really sorry.</b>

13:03.880 --> 13:06.920
<b>We just need a room
for treatment and a bedroom.</b>

13:07.440 --> 13:09.740
<b>Then… the first floor is all yours.</b>

13:10.060 --> 13:12.140
<b>But the second floor is mine.</b>

13:12.840 --> 13:14.480
<b>No problem. Thank you very much.</b>

13:14.860 --> 13:15.810
<b>We have a place to stay now, Lily.</b>

13:16.280 --> 13:20.600
<b>I don't know whether to
be happy or sad right now…</b>

13:25.220 --> 13:26.320
<b>Ah…</b>

13:26.320 --> 13:27.840
<b>I'm so bored.</b>

13:28.280 --> 13:29.260
<b>Isn't it good?</b>

13:29.580 --> 13:31.220
<b>We had time to clean the house properly.</b>

13:32.240 --> 13:34.640
<b>Finally, it looks a bit like a clinic.</b>

13:35.200 --> 13:37.320
<b>Borrowed from a wraith, though.</b>

13:37.640 --> 13:39.480
<b>That's true.</b>

13:39.840 --> 13:42.960
<b>Do you need me to go out
and help with the publicity?</b>

13:43.640 --> 13:46.560
<b>I even made a nurse dress.</b>

13:46.900 --> 13:48.240
<b>Hmm…</b>

13:48.900 --> 13:53.060
<b>If we go out for publicity,
the Royal Medical Institute might notice.</b>

13:53.560 --> 13:56.560
<b>But if we do nothing,
we won't have any customers.</b>

13:56.840 --> 13:58.080
<b>Don't worry.</b>

13:58.080 --> 13:59.760
<b>I think someone will come soon.</b>

14:00.100 --> 14:01.040
<b>Is that so?</b>

14:01.940 --> 14:03.900
<b>Is this Zenos's clinic?</b>

14:04.200 --> 14:05.720
<b>Wow, someone came.</b>

14:06.560 --> 14:07.740
<b>Hello.</b>

14:07.980 --> 14:09.280
<b>Uh, huh?</b>

14:09.660 --> 14:11.560
<b>I think I've seen this person before.</b>

14:12.220 --> 14:13.280
<b>I was expecting you.</b>

14:13.560 --> 14:15.560
<b>Did you know I would come?</b>

14:16.180 --> 14:19.760
<b>Burns caused by a magic gun aren't
something an ordinary person would have.</b>

14:20.360 --> 14:22.080
<b>And people like you</b>

14:22.080 --> 14:25.320
<b>usually cannot go to a regular clinic
for various reasons.</b>

14:25.740 --> 14:27.140
<b>I am Zonde.</b>

14:27.460 --> 14:29.560
<b>Can you please treat my sister today?</b>

14:30.200 --> 14:33.480
<b>My brother said
you're a very skilled healer.</b>

14:33.860 --> 14:34.850
<b>Would you treat me?</b>

14:35.280 --> 14:37.040
<b>I don't know if I'm skilled,</b>

14:37.040 --> 14:38.540
<b>but that much I can do.</b>

14:39.620 --> 14:41.360
<b>I got shot in the arm.</b>

14:41.540 --> 14:43.320
<b>The injury isn't looking better.</b>

14:44.100 --> 14:46.740
<b>Must be a magic gun with toxic effects.</b>

14:47.040 --> 14:49.600
<b>The bullet left in the body will
gradually corrode the surrounding tissue.</b>

14:49.940 --> 14:51.640
<b>You knew just by looking at it?</b>

14:51.940 --> 14:54.720
<b>I was once almost taken away
to test that kind of weapon.</b>

14:55.260 --> 14:57.640
<b>People are evil, eh?</b>

14:57.980 --> 14:59.100
<b>Absolutely.</b>

14:59.260 --> 15:01.790
<b>I just made up my mind
that one day I'll take revenge.</b>

15:02.080 --> 15:03.420
<b>So, can you cure me?</b>

15:03.740 --> 15:05.620
<b>Your arm is beyond saving.</b>

15:05.960 --> 15:08.580
<b>It's best to amputate the entire arm
before the toxin spreads further.</b>

15:09.720 --> 15:11.140
<b>It seems that's the only way.</b>

15:11.640 --> 15:12.680
<b>How much will it cost?</b>

15:12.980 --> 15:14.000
<b>One million coins.</b>

15:14.280 --> 15:15.360
<b>What did you say?</b>

15:15.880 --> 15:18.080
<b>You're charging us
one million coins for an amputation?</b>

15:18.080 --> 15:19.300
<b>Calm down, Zonde.</b>

15:20.040 --> 15:22.980
<b>A bit avaricious, aren't you, doctor?</b>

15:23.780 --> 15:27.620
<b>Would you insist
if you knew I was Zophia the Swift?</b>

15:28.300 --> 15:30.240
<b>So you are Zophia the Swift.</b>

15:30.680 --> 15:32.780
<b>I didn't expect a big shot so soon.</b>

15:33.740 --> 15:36.840
<b>She's one of the big shots in the slums,
leading the lizard people.</b>

15:37.420 --> 15:39.500
<b>She robs those crooked merchants</b>

15:39.720 --> 15:42.580
<b>and returns part of the money
to the people in the slums.</b>

15:43.220 --> 15:46.160
<b>Just for amputating one arm,
you charge me one million coins.</b>

15:46.480 --> 15:49.620
<b>Then give me a reason I can accept.</b>

15:49.620 --> 15:50.880
<b>Otherwise…</b>

15:50.880 --> 15:51.860
<b>Listen,</b>

15:51.860 --> 15:53.930
<b>I didn't say it's just amputating the arm.</b>

15:54.380 --> 15:56.220
<b>What's the point
if the arm doesn't regenerate?</b>

15:56.760 --> 15:58.420
<b>Regenerating the arm
is a very tiring task.</b>

15:58.820 --> 16:00.600
<b>I don't want to work for free anymore.</b>

16:00.600 --> 16:01.580
<b>What?</b>

16:01.960 --> 16:04.960
<b>I don't care
if you are a slum leader or a king,</b>

16:05.220 --> 16:06.900
<b>I charge
corresponding to the effort I put in.</b>

16:07.020 --> 16:08.980
<b>What exactly are you talking about?</b>

16:09.240 --> 16:11.900
<b>I've never heard of any healer
who can regenerate limbs.</b>

16:12.020 --> 16:12.760
<b>Huh?</b>

16:12.760 --> 16:14.520
<b>Other healers can't do it?</b>

16:14.760 --> 16:15.660
<b>Are you kidding me?</b>

16:15.900 --> 16:17.920
<b>I never received formal education.</b>

16:17.920 --> 16:19.280
<b>I don't have any common knowledge.</b>

16:19.720 --> 16:21.120
<b>Can I start the treatment now?</b>

16:21.580 --> 16:22.420
<b>Okay.</b>

16:22.580 --> 16:24.800
<b>If you can really do it.</b>

16:25.600 --> 16:26.600
<b>Scalpel.</b>

16:27.160 --> 16:28.740
<b>Wha… what's that?</b>

16:28.740 --> 16:29.520
<b>Huh?</b>

16:29.760 --> 16:32.160
<b>It's a sharp blade I created with magic.</b>

16:32.400 --> 16:34.980
<b>The blade is clean and can be used freely.</b>

16:35.240 --> 16:38.260
<b>I haven't heard of a healer
using such a tool.</b>

16:38.620 --> 16:39.620
<b>Is that so?</b>

16:39.940 --> 16:41.980
<b>Then what do others use for cutting?</b>

16:42.660 --> 16:44.960
<b>Casting automatic healing magic locally</b>

16:44.960 --> 16:46.280
<b>to alleviate her pain.</b>

16:48.300 --> 16:49.020
<b>Alright.</b>

16:49.740 --> 16:51.080
<b>Now comes the main part.</b>

16:52.260 --> 16:55.860
<b>After using protective magic to stop the bleeding,
cast multiple healing spells</b>

16:56.180 --> 16:58.200
<b>to accelerate the regeneration
by 10,000 times.</b>

16:59.200 --> 17:00.320
<b>First, the bones.</b>

17:03.280 --> 17:04.520
<b>Next, the nerves.</b>

17:06.340 --> 17:07.920
<b>Then, the blood vessels and muscles.</b>

17:08.380 --> 17:09.960
<b>Finally, the skin.</b>

17:11.360 --> 17:12.400
<b>Alright, it's done.</b>

17:12.920 --> 17:14.680
<b>Ah… I'm exhausted.</b>

17:15.320 --> 17:17.500
<b>It wouldn't be this tiring
if I finished the job casually.</b>

17:17.940 --> 17:20.860
<b>But to restore the arm perfectly,
it takes quite a bit of effort.</b>

17:21.420 --> 17:23.020
<b>You've worked hard, Zenos.</b>

17:23.480 --> 17:25.420
<b>That's quite a shock.</b>

17:25.920 --> 17:27.800
<b>I've never seen a healer like you.</b>

17:27.800 --> 17:29.360
<b>Huh, what is that?</b>

17:30.060 --> 17:31.640
<b>That's the wraith that lives here with me.</b>

17:31.900 --> 17:33.740
<b>You live with a wraith?</b>

17:33.740 --> 17:34.440
<b>Tsk.</b>

17:34.440 --> 17:36.680
<b>You might as well accidentally kill her.</b>

17:37.120 --> 17:38.540
<b>I really want to absorb some life force.</b>

17:38.540 --> 17:40.530
<b>Hey, she just said something ominous.</b>

17:40.820 --> 17:41.900
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

17:41.900 --> 17:43.120
<b>She's not bad by nature.</b>

17:43.120 --> 17:44.450
<b>I doubt that!</b>

17:47.660 --> 17:49.480
<b>Doctor, you are really amazing.</b>

17:49.700 --> 17:51.340
<b>And very interesting too.</b>

17:51.800 --> 17:52.900
<b>I like you.</b>

17:52.900 --> 17:55.180
<b>I'll need you to treat my people too.</b>

17:55.740 --> 17:57.980
<b>Of course, the fee won't be lacking.</b>

18:02.100 --> 18:03.890
<b>Zenos, the black tea is ready.</b>

18:04.500 --> 18:05.280
<b>Thank you.</b>

18:05.540 --> 18:06.740
<b>Lily, you're so considerate.</b>

18:08.240 --> 18:09.400
<b>Praise me, please.</b>

18:13.460 --> 18:16.000
<b>By the way, why are there three cups?</b>

18:16.520 --> 18:18.660
<b>It's your cup, mine, and Miss Carmilla's.</b>

18:19.080 --> 18:20.120
<b>Does she drink tea?</b>

18:20.540 --> 18:21.620
<b>Of course I do.</b>

18:21.620 --> 18:22.160
<b>You do?</b>

18:23.060 --> 18:24.780
<b>Be careful, it's hot.</b>

18:25.920 --> 18:27.410
<b>Indeed, I need to be careful.</b>

18:28.280 --> 18:30.640
<b>What kind of wraith
would get scalded by hot tea?</b>

18:30.900 --> 18:33.800
<b>I heard that, do you want me
to kick you out of the house?</b>

18:34.100 --> 18:37.940
<b>Thanks to Miss Zophia,
our customers are growing.</b>

18:37.940 --> 18:38.760
<b>Yes.</b>

18:39.540 --> 18:41.940
<b>You didn't even kill one person,
how boring.</b>

18:41.940 --> 18:44.420
<b>It's hot!</b>

18:45.980 --> 18:47.080
<b>Hey, Zenos.</b>

18:47.080 --> 18:50.060
<b>Why do those lizard people
often get injured?</b>

18:50.460 --> 18:52.810
<b>I think they must have conflicts
with other factions.</b>

18:53.640 --> 18:56.320
<b>There are three major
demi-human gangs in the slums.</b>

18:56.320 --> 18:57.960
<b>There have always
been disputes among them.</b>

18:58.500 --> 19:00.760
<b>The lizardmen, the orcs, and…</b>

19:01.580 --> 19:02.660
<b>What's that sound?</b>

19:02.900 --> 19:05.700
<b>Seems like another gang is visiting us.</b>

19:12.240 --> 19:14.480
<b>Are you the unlicensed healer, Zenos?</b>

19:14.960 --> 19:17.880
<b>I am Lynga, the leader
of the wolf beastkin in the slums.</b>

19:18.520 --> 19:21.500
<b>The one in charge of
the entire underground casino,</b>

19:21.720 --> 19:23.120
<b>Lynga the Tyrant?</b>

19:23.460 --> 19:26.350
<b>Big shots from the underworld
are coming one after another…</b>

19:26.940 --> 19:29.100
<b>Although we are technically closed,</b>

19:29.600 --> 19:31.420
<b>I can check on
critically injured patients.</b>

19:31.760 --> 19:33.350
<b>The critically injured is here,</b>

19:33.900 --> 19:35.200
<b>that is you, Zenos.</b>

19:35.820 --> 19:39.600
<b>No matter how I crush Zophia's gang,
they recover quickly.</b>

19:40.160 --> 19:42.110
<b>My puzzlement led me here.</b>

19:42.640 --> 19:43.700
<b>Zenos.</b>

19:43.700 --> 19:46.450
<b>It seems you are quite a skilled healer.</b>

19:47.200 --> 19:50.870
<b>I am just an ordinary, unlicensed healer.</b>

19:51.260 --> 19:53.420
<b>I am going to kill you now.</b>

19:53.420 --> 19:54.420
<b>Are you listening to me?</b>

19:54.760 --> 19:57.090
<b>Then no one will be able
to treat Zophia's people.</b>

19:57.540 --> 19:59.300
<b>Are you listening?</b>

19:59.300 --> 20:01.220
<b>Then I can defeat Zophia!</b>

20:04.560 --> 20:06.010
<b>Why didn't your head fly off?</b>

20:06.740 --> 20:08.940
<b>You are not listening at all.</b>

20:09.420 --> 20:11.640
<b>Lily, it's dangerous here,
hide in the inner room.</b>

20:12.140 --> 20:13.520
<b>Hmm…</b>

20:14.380 --> 20:16.160
<b>My protective magic is self-taught,</b>

20:16.160 --> 20:16.940
<b>but it should work fine.</b>

20:17.340 --> 20:18.400
<b>How is that possible?</b>

20:18.640 --> 20:21.000
<b>My axe couldn't hurt him at all…</b>

20:21.400 --> 20:22.200
<b>Attack him!</b>

20:22.200 --> 20:23.120
<b>Yes, boss!</b>

20:27.500 --> 20:28.700
<b>Hey, have you fought enough?</b>

20:29.060 --> 20:30.700
<b>Not… not yet.</b>

20:30.700 --> 20:32.240
<b>Fine…</b>

20:32.240 --> 20:34.170
<b>Guys, tear this place apart!</b>

20:34.420 --> 20:35.480
<b>Yes, boss!</b>

20:35.480 --> 20:37.500
<b>Oh, I advise you not to do that.</b>

20:39.440 --> 20:42.720
<b>If I can't kill you, I'll destroy
the place where you treat others.</b>

20:43.440 --> 20:45.680
<b>You really don't listen at all.</b>

20:46.420 --> 20:47.520
<b>Hey.</b>

20:47.880 --> 20:48.760
<b>I won't take responsibility.</b>

20:50.700 --> 20:51.100
<b>Eek.</b>

20:51.340 --> 20:51.640
<b>Eh?</b>

20:52.020 --> 20:52.560
<b>Wrai…</b>

20:52.560 --> 20:53.120
<b>Wraith.</b>

20:53.120 --> 20:54.020
<b>It's wraith!</b>

20:54.320 --> 20:56.400
<b>How dare you cause trouble on my turf?</b>

20:56.740 --> 20:57.900
<b>Unforgivable!</b>

20:57.900 --> 20:59.300
<b>- We're dead!
- Mama!</b>

21:00.480 --> 21:01.800
<b>Wait, Carmilla.</b>

21:02.200 --> 21:03.320
<b>I can understand your feelings.</b>

21:03.800 --> 21:06.360
<b>Seeing the treatment room being destroyed,</b>

21:06.560 --> 21:07.920
<b>I'm not happy about it either.</b>

21:08.180 --> 21:09.660
<b>It's just perfect.</b>

21:09.660 --> 21:11.370
<b>I want to take their lives.</b>

21:11.800 --> 21:13.300
<b>Your room is on the 2nd floor.</b>

21:13.700 --> 21:15.540
<b>If they go to the 2nd floor,
do as you please with them.</b>

21:15.920 --> 21:18.800
<b>But the treatment room
on the 1st floor is for saving lives.</b>

21:18.800 --> 21:19.960
<b>I can't let you take lives here.</b>

21:20.540 --> 21:21.620
<b>I got it.</b>

21:22.140 --> 21:23.090
<b>This is really annoying.</b>

21:23.920 --> 21:25.940
<b>Thank you for getting angry for me.</b>

21:26.360 --> 21:28.300
<b>I… I wasn't angry for you.</b>

21:28.300 --> 21:29.430
<b>It was for myself.</b>

21:29.960 --> 21:32.640
<b>Because the place is much
more comfortable than before.</b>

21:35.540 --> 21:38.270
<b>The wraith followed his order…</b>

21:39.100 --> 21:40.020
<b>Master Zenos!</b>

21:40.020 --> 21:41.480
<b>I… I'm very sorry!</b>

21:41.760 --> 21:44.780
<b>I didn't know
you were the master of wraith.</b>

21:45.060 --> 21:46.610
<b>Actually, I'm not her master.</b>

21:47.060 --> 21:49.700
<b>We wolf beastkins are the dependents
of the nocturnal creatures.</b>

21:50.160 --> 21:52.820
<b>Towards higher races
like the wraith and vampires,</b>

21:52.820 --> 21:55.180
<b>we instinctively feel fear.</b>

21:55.180 --> 21:58.800
<b>We were disrespectful towards you,
the master of the wraith.</b>

21:58.800 --> 22:00.340
<b>I told you I'm not her master…</b>

22:00.680 --> 22:02.600
<b>Brothers, kneel!</b>

22:02.600 --> 22:04.700
<b>Show our respect to Master Zenos!</b>

22:04.700 --> 22:05.920
<b>Yes, boss!</b>

22:06.460 --> 22:09.720
<b>I forgot they can't
understand human language.</b>

22:15.520 --> 22:17.560
<b>You are
the unlicensed healer Zenos, right?</b>

22:17.980 --> 22:21.120
<b>The leader of orcs, Lady Loewe,
asks you to meet her.</b>

22:22.020 --> 22:23.680
<b>A new guest?</b>

23:55.490 --> 23:59.950
<b>Struggle</b>

23:57.430 --> 23:59.320
<b>Struggle.</b>
